flowchart LR
  R[Approved release requirements] --> UX[Accessible native UX\nSwiftUI / Compose]
  UX --> IOS[iOS build\nXcode Cloud or managed macOS CI]
  UX --> AND[Android build\nGradle managed CI]
  IOS --> IT[Unit, UI, accessibility, security tests]
  AND --> AT[Unit, UI, accessibility, security tests]
  IT --> IB[Signed iOS archive]
  AT --> AB[Signed Android App Bundle]
  IB --> TF[TestFlight internal then external testing]
  AB --> PC[Play Console internal then closed testing]
  TF --> RVC[Release candidate review]
  PC --> RVC
  RVC --> META[Store metadata, privacy/data safety, deletion path, support URL, screenshots]
  META --> APPLE[App Store Connect submission]
  META --> GOOGLE[Google Play production rollout]
  APPLE --> MON[Crash, security, API, and business monitoring]
  GOOGLE --> MON
  MON --> R
